OL,3,A'Putney pusher' suspect found dead at
OL,4,Ahome
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man suspected of pushing a woman
OL,7,Finto the path of a bus during a run on
OL,8,FPutney Bridge in west London in 2017,
OL,9,Fhas been found dead at his home.
OL,11,FNicholas Brandram, 44, was under
OL,12,Finvestigation in the so-called "Putney
OL,13,Fpusher" case, after CCTV went viral
OL,14,Fshowing just how close the woman came
OL,15,Fto being run over by the 430 bus, in a
OL,16,Fseemingly unprovoked attack.
OL,18,FHe was arrested in June this year on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of attempted grievous bodily
OL,20,Fharm. Last week, the Metropolitan
OL,21,FPolice confirmed he had been released
OL,22,Funder investigation.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
