OL,3,ASnapchat 'willing to implement' daily
OL,4,Atime limits for teens, boss tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis comments came as the firm revealed
OL,7,Fa slew of new features for its upcoming
OL,8,FSpecs glasses, which it said could
OL,9,Fconnect to Apple iPhone and Mac
OL,10,Fdevices.
OL,12,FMeta has been pressuring other social
OL,13,Fmedia companies to join it in making
OL,14,Fplatform changes it agreed to as part
OL,15,Fof a recent multi-billion dollar legal
OL,16,Fsettlement with US states.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
